# The whole directory, not just cache/ — this is for git-status hygiene only (kndo's own
# `.kndo/.gitignore`, written by `cache::FactsCache::open`, is what actually keeps `cache/`
# out of `git add -A`; discovery.rs excludes `.kndo/` from analysis unconditionally,
# independent of this file, since a project's first-ever run predates any gitignore entry).
.kndo/

# Conformance fixture corpora (RFC 0002 §8) are deliberately-flawed test data — checked into
# git, exercised via the conformance harness's own `cargo test` run, but excluded from kndo's
# self-check of its own repo (ROADMAP M1 exit: "kndo check on kndo's own JS-free repo returns
# cleanly"). The `ignore` crate reads this file for its glob rules regardless of git-tracked
# status, so this line doesn't affect version control at all.
**/tests/fixtures/
docs/book/
